This package reuses the MuJoCo-GS-Web frontend and the locally adapted
mujoco_robonix simulation integration. The inherited MIT text is retained
in LICENSE. Newly added Go2 integration code is provided under Apache-2.0
(LICENSE.Apache-2.0); third-party code and assets retain their original licenses.

Unitree Go2 MJCF and meshes: assets/robots/go2/LICENSE.unitree (BSD-3-Clause).
go2_rl_gym policy: assets/robots/go2/policy/moe_rough/UPSTREAM.md.
go2_rl_gym courses: each course's LICENSE.upstream and provenance.json.
SceneSmith example dataset: assets/environments/LICENSE.scenesmith and
each house's NOTICE.md and provenance.json.

Robonix services are separate upstream packages fetched by rbnx build;
their licenses remain authoritative within their own source repositories.
